msgstr "なにひとつ見えない暗闇の底へ――"

#: badend4:unlabelled:badend4:17
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9b986f1925cc942f6afb2a286f8031c7825fb58e99abc5b6f08f9bf396b6f00f
